# Terror Tide: "All creatures get -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of permanent cards in your graveyard" (CR 110.4a).
# On turn 1 Bot1's Faithless Looting discards the permanent cards Ornithopter and Swamp, so X is 2 (the Looting and the Terror Tide
# are not permanent cards): Bot1's own Memnite, Bot2's Memnite and Bot2's 0/2 Ornithopter (which -1/-1 would not kill) all die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Faithless Looting
Terror Tide
Ornithopter
Memnite
Swamp x2
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Swamp)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Terror Tide.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
